        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm card-product">
                <img src="https://otopth.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Untitled-3-300x164.png" class="card-img-top" alt="ชุดเซ็ตสมุนไพร" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                <div class="card-body text-center">
                    <h5 class="card-title fs-6">ชุดเซ็ตสมุนไพร</h5>
                    <p class="text-success fw-bold fs-5 mb-2">฿390</p>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-success w-100 rounded-pill"><i class="bi bi-cart-plus"></i> หยิบใส่ตะกร้า</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-6">
            <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm card-product">
                <img src="https://www.otopchiangmai.com/uploads/8c9e2ace19000131f84330f718b7f327.jpg" class="card-img-top" alt="ตุ๊กตา Re-cycle" style="height: 200px; object-fit: cover;">
                <div class="card-body text-center">
                    <h5 class="card-title fs-6">ตุ๊กตา Re-cycle</h5>
